    "proposal_summary": "Bayfront pond complex where imagery appears to show broken outer dikes, tidal water inside, and lines of what look like mangrove along remnant dikes (our imagery reading). Wetlands International visited fishponds in Calero and Pamarawan (Malolos) and San Roque (Paombong) in Oct-Nov 2022 and describes fishponds lying abandoned, undeveloped, or underutilized; it does not say which ponds, so this block is not claimed to be one of them. Possible hydrological-repair / natural-regeneration candidate; high field-verification need."
